### Register equipment
POST {{host}}/api/v1/equipment
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "buildingId": 1,
  "code": "LP-WP-01",
  "name": "Bomba hidroneumática 1",
  "type": "WATER_PUMP",
  "location": "Sótano 1",
  "installationDate": "2021-03-15"
}

